# EmojiPicker: with no focused window the panel opens centred x 750..1170, y 326..754.
rec em-ipc 1 ipc emoji toggle
note Picker opens centred (x 750..1170, y 326..754), same place and same spring as QML.
wait 1
shot open
note Picker open and settled, same as QML.
rec em-toggle-close 1 ipc emoji toggle
note Second toggle closes the picker (same as QML).
wait 1
ipc emoji close
wait 1
shot closed-noop
note emoji close when already closed does nothing: no picker visible.
ipc panels open emoji TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
shot panels-open
note Picker opened via panels open; same as QML.
key -k Escape
wait 1
ipc emoji toggle
wait 1
shot reopen
note After Escape, Panels forgot it: a second toggle OPENS the picker again (does not close it).
ipc emoji close
# MANUAL: the shortcut (tessera:emoji) - only if the sandbox compositor binds it
